  "title": "Laura's Famous Aebleskiver",
  "description": "This traditional Danish breakfast treat made in an Aebleskiver pan is a cross between a pancake and a popover. Sprinkle with confectioners' sugar or drizzle with maple syrup.",
  "authors": [
    "Laura"
  ],
